{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772650907,"nonce":"k2fa9TG+z1L/dc29DyGUX5ycRTI=","title":"Mandible: periodic git-bug ref sync (push/pull) for all registered repos","message":"Mandible should manage git-bug ref synchronization as a daemon-side policy, replacing the need for per-repo post-commit hooks.\n\n## Design\n\n**Push (phase 1)**\n- Background job runs every N minutes (configurable, default 5)\n- For each registered repo: snapshot `refs/bugs/*` tips via `git for-each-ref`\n- Compare against last-synced snapshot stored in Mandible DB\n- If changed: `git push origin 'refs/bugs/*:refs/bugs/*'`\n\nMigrated from dotfiles issue acd0864.","files":null}]}